{"id":"conv_09223","context":"Elderly couple chats","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","sachiko_grandma"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":"wistful","en":"Your father, back when he was young, he used to say things like 'naa, how happy I am.' I remember that.","jp":"ばあさん、若い頃、お父さんが「なぁー、嬉しいなぁ」と仰ったぞ","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[6,8,9,411,459,837,1055,1738,2861,3469,7769,15911,17311,17964,19103],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ばあさん","w":17311},{"s":"、"},{"s":"若い","r":"わかい","w":1055},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"、"},{"s":"お父さん","r":"おとうさん","w":3469},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"「"},{"s":"なぁー","w":15911},{"s":"、"},{"s":"嬉しい","r":"うれしい","w":1738},{"s":"なぁ","w":459},{"s":"」"},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"仰っ","r":"おっしゃっ","w":19103},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ぞ","w":837}]},{"speaker":"sachiko_grandma","mood":"tender","en":"Yes, he did. You remember how he'd gaze at the moon on summer evenings, don't you?","jp":"うん、お祖父ちゃん、夕べに月を眺めてらしたわよね、あなた?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,4,5,8,48,51,56,68,218,362,379,569,2917,4781,6485,7106,7729,9497,10869,14951,15919],"jpTokens":[{"s":"うん","w":2917},{"s":"、"},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"祖父","r":"そふ","w":7106},{"s":"ちゃん","w":379},{"s":"、"},{"s":"夕べ","r":"ゆうべ","w":15919},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"月","r":"つき","w":48},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"眺め","r":"ながめ","w":7729},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"らし","w":362},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"わ","w":569},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"、"},{"s":"あなた","w":218},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":"wistful","en":"Back then, your father never did anything to shame the family name. He was careful about that.","jp":"ばあさん、若い頃、お父さんは家族の名を損なう事をされなかった","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,8,13,19,58,98,125,255,411,527,1055,3469,3839,15921,17311,17752],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ばあさん","w":17311},{"s":"、"},{"s":"若い","r":"わかい","w":1055},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"、"},{"s":"お父さん","r":"おとうさん","w":3469},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"家族","r":"かぞく","w":527},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"名","r